# [D-CLAUDE-CONFIG] settings.jq is a jq-delta build input that install reads in
# place (apply_jq_deltas onto ~/.claude/settings.json), not a dotfile. Without
# this, stow symlinks it to ~/settings.jq because it sits at the package root.
# Stow replaces its default ignore list when this file exists; the package holds
# nothing else a default pattern would have guarded. See docs/decisions.html#D-CLAUDE-CONFIG.
settings\.jq
